# Inline styles

Regular text with **bold**, *italic*, and ***bold italic*** woven in.

You can ~~strike through~~ a mistake, drop in some `inline code`, and link to
[the repository](https://github.com/agent-habilis/render).

> A blockquote ties it together — with *emphasis* and **strength** inside.

- A list item with **bold**
